def num(v):
    return f'{v:.6g}'

def metrics_table():
    s = '| 统计量（288 坐标/族） | S1：估计值 [95% CI] | S2：估计值 [95% CI] |\n|---|---|---|\n'
    for key, name in [('cosine', 'Cosine'), ('pearson', 'Pearson'), ('spearman', 'Spearman'), ('sign_agreement', '符号一致率'), ('scale_free_slope', '逐单元 RMS 标准化过原点斜率')]:
        vals = []
        for fam in ['S1', 'S2']:
            m = r['families'][fam]['metrics'][key]
            vals.append(f"{num(m['estimate'])} [{num(m['ci95'][0])}, {num(m['ci95'][1])}]")
        s += '| ' + name + ' | ' + ' | '.join(vals) + ' |\n'
    return s

def cell_table():
    s = '| 族 | g | 已分辨种子 | Cosine | Pearson | Spearman | 符号一致率 | 平均 P_B(full) | 功率比 |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n'
    for c in cells:
        s += f"| {c['family']} | {c['g']} | {c['resolved_seed_count']}/8 | {num(c['cosine'])} | {num(c['pearson'])} | {num(c['spearman'])} | {num(c['sign_agreement'])} | {num(c['P_B_full_mean'])} | {num(c['power_ratio_of_seed_means'])} |\n"
    return s + '\n功率比为同一单元内八个种子的平均 P_B(full) / 平均 P_B(restricted)；逐种子比值的中位数及范围亦保存在 CSV。\n'
impact = f"# Full-tangent scientific impact v283M\n\n最终冻结分类：`{r['classification']}`。本次是冻结前瞻协议下的确定性本地执行，主判定先于方向探针完成。所有历史来源只读，稿件 v283M 未修改。\n\n## 1. 历史受限响应是否为输出投影切线限制？\n\n是，在相同特征求值下，它在代数上严格等于所声明的 isotropic trace 输出投影限制。子专家输出权重的导数给出 d 个相同特征内积；除以 d*m 后为 phi_x^T phi_y/m。输出权重原本复制时乘以 g，这不改变对独立子专家输出权重的导数。G=I/m 是本次明确规定的欧氏度量，不是历史 AdamW 的预条件器。\n\n64 条历史 B_coordinates 和 P_B 的精确复现误差为零。固定样本上的同特征输出投影梯度恒等式通过。不同算术精度下的特征值不宣称逐比特一致：完整解析计算用 float64，历史特征用原始 MPS float32。曾把跨精度比较误作恒等式的检查已修正，并保留原尝试与差值，详见 IMPLEMENTATION_AUDIT_PRECISION_NOTE_v283M.md。\n\n## 2. 扩展为完整专家切线后是否保留同一带符号通道？\n\n场空间的 C-only 结构在两族所有 g 上均保留；g=1 为精确结构零，A/M 泄漏满足冻结阈值。但“几何处于 C”不能替代受限/完整有符号坐标的统计一致。S1 的所有主关联置信下界通过；S2 仅部分一致，不能将两族合并升级为确认。S2 g=2 的三个关联点估计略为负值，符号一致率低于 0.5，必须保留这项单元诊断。\n\n## 3. 哪些单元已分辨？\n\nS1 与 S2 的 g=2,4,8 全部 8/8 种子通过 H1。各单元 tau_P=1e-20；g=1 作为结构暗控制，不作已分辨正响应。\n\n{cell_table()}\n## 4. 关联强度和种子聚类不确定性\n\n每族 288 个带符号坐标，八个整种子为重采样单位，每次保留该种子的全部 3 个 g 和 12 个有序域对。PCG64(2026101201)，20,000 次重采样，95% percentile CI。回归在每次重采样内分别按 family × g 对两种坐标做 RMS 标准化，再拟合过原点斜率。不得将 288 坐标当作独立推断单位。\n\n{metrics_table()}\nS2 未通过的冻结确认标准恰为 Spearman 下界严格为正，以及符号一致率下界严格超过 0.5。其余 S2 标准通过；Pearson 下界接近零，应如实报告。\n\n## 5. 是否足以收窄稿件范围声明？\n\n不足以整体收窄。可以在 v284M 或更后版本新增“输出投影限制的代数识别”以及“全专家块 isotropic trace 基准的部分一致”作为新的方法与结果记录；必须保留受限响应与一般 B_ts 的区别。不得把历史受限响应改写为跨架构、跨 g 已验证的完整带符号 susceptibility 代理。本次不要求创建 v284M；建议稿见 MANUSCRIPT_PATCH_FULL_TANGENT_v283M.md，仅作咨询文本。\n\n## 6. 对任意残差加权完整 B_ts 仍未验证什么？\n\n本次固定了输出空间 isotropic trace、G=I/m 和独立子专家参数块。任意源残差、目标探针、非各向同性输出权重、优化器相关度量、路由参数、公共偏置、归一化参数及其他共享/非专家参数均未被本次一般化验证。四个次级正交方向探针出现方向依赖及负关联，进一步说明均匀方向平均结果不能推广至任意探针。该次级检查不能改变主分类。没有下游效用或普适学习率/优化器结论，也不修改已验证的参数到场模式转换结果。\n"
(OUT / 'FULL_TANGENT_SCIENTIFIC_IMPACT_v283M.md').write_text(impact)
patch = '# Advisory manuscript patch for v284M or later\n\nThis file does not modify v283M. Final benchmark label: PARTIAL_CHANNEL_AGREEMENT. A general narrowing of the manuscript scope disclaimer is not warranted. A future version may add the following qualified methods/results statement, with the complete evidence archived separately.\n\n## Proposed methods/results text\n\nFor independently addressable copied child-expert parameters, we evaluated the Euclidean expert-block tangent with G_c=I/m and the isotropic output contraction k_full=(dm)^(-1) Tr[J_c(h_x)J_c(h_y)^T]. Its output-projection restriction algebraically equals the historical normalized feature kernel when the feature evaluation is held fixed. The complete child blocks include both GELU input weights and input biases plus output weights in Pythia, and gate, up and down weights in SmolLM2. The common Pythia output bias, router, normalization and other shared parameters are excluded.\n\nThe full geometry remained confined to C, with structural zero at g=1 and resolved full response power in all six nontrivial family/granularity cells (8/8 seeds each). Whole-seed bootstrap association tests supported alignment in Pythia. SmolLM2 showed positive family-level point estimates but failed the preregistered Spearman and sign-agreement confidence-bound criteria, yielding PARTIAL_CHANNEL_AGREEMENT overall. Its g=2 signed association was weak and slightly negative. These results establish the geometric selection structure under the declared full expert-block observable but do not validate the historical restricted response as a uniformly reliable signed proxy across both families and all granularities.\n\n## Retain the scope limitation\n\nThe historical restricted observable, the isotropic full expert-block benchmark, and arbitrary residual/probe-weighted B_ts remain distinct. The present benchmark uses a fixed Euclidean metric rather than an optimizer-dependent susceptibility, and does not establish agreement for every source residual or target probe. Direction-specific secondary diagnostics do not alter the primary label and show substantial variability. No downstream utility or universal optimizer/learning-rate conclusion follows.\n\n## Editing decision\n\nDo not replace existing scope disclaimers with a claim of full-response validation. No manuscript v283M file was changed. Reporting this additional partial benchmark in v284M is optional; a v284M scope-narrowing update is not scientifically warranted.\n'
(OUT / 'MANUSCRIPT_PATCH_FULL_TANGENT_v283M.md').write_text(patch)
